date-released: "2026-08-26"
keywords:
  - protein structure
  - crystallographic refinement
  - cross-tool validation
  - negative-control benchmark
  - preregistration
abstract: >-
  Quality-assessment harness for agent-refined or generated protein structures.
  Independent oracles (PHENIX, CCP4, gemmi, biotite) are compared rather than
  trusted singly; tolerances are calibrated by preregistered benchmark rounds and
  a negative-control series of gold-standard sub-Ångström structures.
